            "notes": "Build Code: Z2BSX - I don't put round 1 items into my build code since those aren't major choices.\n\nShoot things to get dmg and survive. [Compensator](item_2a354f80-610c-4661-9bdd-8960ae1a60b0), [Power Playbook](item_6d8803cf-baa7-46ee-af91-51e7f2301418), and a survival item:  [Armored Vest](item_358361e2-59be-4c81-b221-8a87f37809e6) \n\nGo for kills if you can if a character goes out of position, but it's better to stay in the back and not feed....\n\nORRRRR\n\nJust feed this round, it's a warmup round and doesn't really matter. Just remember to get [Hunter's Mark](item_6258ca51-d9dc-47b5-8e85-782c05072485) next round and you'll be fiiiine.",
