            "created_at": "2025-09-17T21:29:11.847127+00:00",
            "notes": "Repeating what I say in the description: [Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d) pairs insanely well with [Redux](item_e27dc8d9-4fa9-4e55-bf9a-7a4b3532a0d8) - Getting a FULL second of your arrow sticking in someone allows you that much more time to reduce your cooldowns while they're additionally slowed making it easier for everyone to kill your target. \n\n [Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d)'s timing can also confuse your opponents as the pace of your damage now changes allowing for more \"SURPRISE: DEATH\" :). \n\n[Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d) also gives your enemies a full second to evade that burst damage...so keep that in mind. If they have a kiri, her cleanse will drop those arrows to the floor. I still find it worth it. oh and:\n\nLMAO [Liquid Nitrogen](item_a8d99526-05a3-4405-babb-b025479b1b98) +[Toxin Tips](item_37a11564-aef7-4e13-83de-1a4b949cd28d) and watch your enemies wade through molasses. \n\nIf you're a new [Freja](hero_e80840a1-845d-4008-966c-585b7cb4a424) player, you can get SO much better by spending some time in the practice range playing around with her Quick Dash. Did you know you can dash straight upwards? That it both resets the Hover AND insta-reloads your Take-Aim? You can hit some gnarly shots with in the air dash practice.",
